%%{ init: { "theme": "dark" } }%%
flowchart TD
    Start([User wants Graphify/RTK]) --> CheckInstall{Tool installed?}

    CheckInstall -->|No| RunInstall["didio install-graphify<br/>OR didio install-rtk"]
    RunInstall --> PlatformDetect{Platform?}
    PlatformDetect -->|Graphify| UV["uv tool install graphifyy<br/>graphify install"]
    PlatformDetect -->|RTK + Windows| Winget["winget install rtk-ai.rtk"]
    PlatformDetect -->|RTK + macOS/Linux| Brew["brew install rtk"]
    UV --> SanityCheck["Sanity: tool --version"]
    Winget --> SanityCheck
    Brew --> SanityCheck
    SanityCheck --> EnableConfig

    CheckInstall -->|Yes| EnableConfig["Enable in didio.config.json<br/>graphify.enabled: true<br/>OR rtk.enabled: true"]

    EnableConfig --> SmokeCheck["Smoke check<br/>(automatic on wave start)"]
    SmokeCheck --> Available{Binary on PATH?}
    Available -->|Yes| Ready([Tool ready])
    Available -->|No| Warn["WARN: degraded gracefully<br/>(pipeline continues)"]

    Ready --> UseGraphify["didio graphify query <file><br/>Nudge on Read (hook)"]
    Ready --> UseRTK["RTK auto-compresses<br/>bash output (user hook)"]

    subgraph RTKPostInstall["RTK post-install (manual)"]
        RTKInit["User runs: rtk init -g<br/>(modifies ~/.claude/settings.json)"]
    end

    EnableConfig -->|RTK only| RTKInit
    RTKInit --> UseRTK
